msgstr "Tko ima ovlasti osoblja: parovi ime:razina odvojeni zarezom, gdje je razina admin, sponsor ili employee. Administratori mogu uključiti administratorski način. Ovdje ne možeš ukloniti vlastitu administratorsku ovlast."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:55
msgid "Moderators and staff (employees, and admins for admin mode) need two-factor sign-in turned on (preferences, security) to use their tools; until then they see a notice asking them to. Members without it are unaffected."
msgstr "Moderatori i osoblje (zaposlenici, te administratori za administratorski način) moraju imati uključenu dvostruku prijavu (postavke, sigurnost) za korištenje svojih alata; do tada vide obavijest koja ih na to poziva. Ostali članovi nisu pogođeni."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:60
msgid "How long a page for logged-out visitors may be kept and served again, in seconds, by nginx's page cache or a CDN in front of the site (logged-in visitors always get fresh pages). Lower it to show changes sooner, or 0 to stop caching pages at once. nginx's page cache has to be on (the installer's TIPPR_PAGE_CACHE_SECONDS) for a value here to do anything there."
msgstr "Koliko dugo, u sekundama, nginxova predmemorija stranica ili CDN ispred stranice smiju čuvati i ponovno posluživati stranicu za odjavljene posjetitelje (prijavljeni posjetitelji uvijek dobivaju svježe stranice). Smanji za brži prikaz promjena ili postavi 0 za trenutni prestanak predmemoriranja stranica. Nginxova predmemorija stranica mora biti uključena (TIPPR_PAGE_CACHE_SECONDS u instalacijskom programu) da bi ova vrijednost tamo imala učinka."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:67
msgid "Accounts with at least this much post karma skip the captcha."
msgstr "Računi s barem ovoliko karme objava preskaču captchu."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:69
msgid "Accounts with at least this much comment karma skip the captcha."
msgstr "Računi s barem ovoliko karme komentara preskaču captchu."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:71
msgid "How old an account must be, in days, to create a vault (admins can always create one)."
msgstr "Koliko dana mora biti star račun za izradu vaulta (administratori ga uvijek mogu napraviti)."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:74
msgid "Post karma needed to create a vault (this, or the comment karma below)."
msgstr "Karma objava potrebna za izradu vaulta (ova ili karma komentara ispod)."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:77
msgid "Comment karma needed to create a vault (this, or the post karma above)."
msgstr "Karma komentara potrebna za izradu vaulta (ova ili karma objava iznad)."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:80
msgid "A notice in every page's sidebar. Blank: none."
msgstr "Obavijest na bočnoj traci svake stranice. Prazno: ništa."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:82
msgid "Messages for the \"new here?\" bar shown to logged-out visitors, each in double quotes; one is picked at random. \" / \" splits a message into a heading and a smaller second line, e.g. \"Welcome! / Pick a few vaults to subscribe to.\""
msgstr "Poruke za traku \"novi si ovdje?\" koja se prikazuje odjavljenim posjetiteljima, svaka u dvostrukim navodnicima; jedna se bira nasumično. \" / \" dijeli poruku na naslov i manji drugi redak, npr. \"Dobrodošao! / Odaberi nekoliko vaulta na koje ćeš se pretplatiti.\""

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:87
msgid "A message in the info bar at the top of listings. For a site-wide banner, use the announcement on /admin/site instead."
msgstr "Poruka na informacijskoj traci na vrhu popisa. Za natpis na cijeloj stranici koristi obavijest na /admin/site."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:90
msgid "Vaults that help people find more vaults, for the explore tab: names, comma-separated."
msgstr "Vaulti koji pomažu ljudima pronaći još vaulta, za karticu istraživanja: imena odvojena zarezom."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:93
msgid "New API apps (registered on /prefs/apps) work only for their own developers until an admin approves them on /admin/apps."
msgstr "Nove API aplikacije (registrirane na /prefs/apps) rade samo za svoje razvojne programere dok ih administrator ne odobri na /admin/apps."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:96
msgid "How old an account must be, in days, to register an API app."
msgstr "Koliko dana mora biti star račun za registraciju API aplikacije."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:98
msgid "Total karma (posts and comments) needed to register an API app."
msgstr "Ukupna karma (objave i komentari) potrebna za registraciju API aplikacije."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:100
msgid "Whether registering an API app needs a verified email address."
msgstr "Treba li registracija API aplikacije potvrđenu adresu e-pošte."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:102
msgid "New comments appear on a thread while people have it open, without reloading. When this is on, each vault's moderators choose whether their vault uses it (in the vault's settings), and each member whether they see it (in their preferences). Needs the websockets service (tippr-websockets) running."
msgstr ""

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:108
msgid "Whether a new vault starts with live comments on (its moderators can change it). Vaults that already exist keep their setting."
msgstr ""

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:111
msgid "Whether a new account starts with live comments on (the member can change it in their preferences); also what logged-out visitors get. Accounts that already exist keep their setting."
msgstr ""

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:115
msgid "The first this many members get the Early Member award, in the order they signed up (the site's own accounts, like AutoModerator and feed bots, don't count). Raising it gives the award to the members it now includes within a day; lowering it doesn't take the award back. 0: nobody gets it automatically (admins can still give it on /admin/awards)."
msgstr ""

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:122
msgid "Busy threads whose new comments get a queue of their own, so a flood of comments there doesn't slow down comments everywhere else: the ids of their posts (the part of a post's address after /comments/), comma-separated. Remove a thread once it calms down."
msgstr ""

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:128
msgid "Votes a post or comment needs before it can count as controversial."
